gc-cameras-dkms (0.2.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * gti5035: build on kernel 7.2+ (drop linux/of_gpio.h and manual
    gpio_free(); GPIOs are devm-managed).
  * Fix camera facing on the Chuwi Hi10 Max: GC8034 is the rear camera,
    GC5035 the front one. gc8034 now exposes read-only camera_orientation
    and camera_sensor_rotation controls for libcamera.
  * install.sh: remove older gc-cameras DKMS versions before installing.

 -- pdamonte <pdamonte@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 00:00:00 -0300

